(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "电梯门打开的同时，一齐看向我的护士们。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00003",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "母亲微微点头礼貌地示意了一下，就像什么也没发生似的回到工作中去了。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00004",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "貌似这里除了患者和家属，以及来探病的人以外，无关人员是进不来的。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00005",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "而且这一层，也和其他楼层有些不同。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00006",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "首先，地板亮闪闪的。天花板也比之前的要高宽很多。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00007",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "而且病房都是单间，没有多人间的样子。听说原则上什么时候来探访都可以。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00008",
),
),
(
